        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 260FL, Classico Collection Floral Half-Round Knobset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Floral Half-Round Knob with Matching Rose looks as if it is among the rich details of the old-world. This beautiful knobset has intricate detailing that truly elevates it into the realm of lavishness. It is a great compliment to traditional decors. Choose from any of the 4 available finishes: Florentine Brass, Siena Brass, Etruscan Bronze (pictured), and Venetian Nickel. All of the finishes are designed to highlight the intricate detailing of both knob and rose. The Omnia 260FL is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions for 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\" thick doors with either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/single-cylinder-ornate-deadbolt-omnia-flordb\">Matching Single Cylinder Deadbolt</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Floral Door Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs.</li>\r\n<li>Full lip strike comes standard.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Classic Floral Knob with Round Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>55 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door knob on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 knob, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door knob on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 rosettes, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, solid spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, slit spindle, and mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-DIVA-Specifications.gif?v=1704354622\" width=\"557\" height=\"103\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Classico Collection Finish Options\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Floral Half-Round Knob with Matching Rose",
                "description": "Omnia 260FL, Floral Half-Round Knob with Matching Rose - The Floral Half-Round Knob with Matching Rose looks as if it is among the rich details of the old-world. This beautiful knobset has intricate detailing that truly elevates it into the realm of lavishness. It is a great compliment to traditional decors. Choose from any of the 4 available finishes: Florentine Brass, Siena Brass, Etruscan Bronze (pictured), and Venetian Nickel. All of the finishes are designed to highlight the intricate detailing of both knob and rose. The Omnia 260FL is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions for 1-3/8 inch, 1-3/4 inch, or 2 inch thick doors with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
